Say what a run's recording holds behind one claim

Usage: njutest why [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  mutation  One mutation of the source
  seam      One question about one exchange on one seam
  fault     One call a `?` asks about, failed by a fault
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --run <RUN>  The run to read. The latest by default
  -h, --help       Print help
